error[graph.bounded_workflow_effect_cycle]: effect cycle in a bounded workflow is not allowed: workflow `BoundedChannelRing` is `@bounded`, and rule cycle echo_forever -> echo_forever runs the effects of rule `echo_forever` on every turn
   --> examples/invalid/bounded-channel-ring.whip:28:3
