28 |   send via ops_room {
   |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: a bounded workflow settles instead of turning, so it may not loop with the world without a proof: give the cycle a measure — an `int` field every hop advances by a literal step, with a rule on the cycle bounding it — or break the cycle, or drop `@bounded` if this workflow is meant to keep going
